Package hclp — HCL decoder + encoder, from scratch (stdlib only). Create /workspace/hclp/hcl.go exporting `func Decode(data []byte, s *settings.Settings) ([]*node.Node, error)` and `func Encode(w io.Writer, nodes []*node.Node, s *settings.Settings) error`, plus hclp/hcl_test.go. Probe the original: `printf 'resource "aws" "x" {
  ami = "abc"
  count = 2
}
' | /workspace/executable -p hcl` — how blocks/labels map to yaml (resource -> aws -> x -> attrs?), attributes with numbers/bools/lists/maps, nested blocks, heredocs?, comments (#, //, /* */); encode `-o hcl` from yaml/json: attribute rendering (key = value), nested maps -> blocks? how are labels chosen (probe!), lists of maps -> repeated blocks?, string quoting, multiple docs. Match probed behavior.

